WEBVTT

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:21.450
Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:39.740
Rio-sensei, I thought magical tools 
masters couldn't use magical tools.

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.080
How did you...

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:42.970
What...

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:46.080
are you talking about?

00:01:49.150 --> 00:01:50.980
Please, Roji-kun.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.880
You're the one who used those talismans.

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.360
No, I...

00:01:58.800 --> 00:01:59.640
Muhyo!

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:02.390
Muhyo, hang in there!

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:04.300
Muhyo...

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:09.040
He normally just goes 
to sleep... What is this?

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:13.400
His hollow eyes are a sign 
that his ren has run dry.

00:02:13.400 --> 00:02:15.320
R-Ren?

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.150
Your ren is basically your mental strength.

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:26.540
<b>Ren</b>

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:22.140
It's necessary for summoning 
messengers and using magical tools.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:24.010
Normally, after enforcing magical law,

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.200
you'd save a bit of ren and simply 
sleep to recover the rest,

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.780
but if it's all used up, you will enter
 a dangerous state of mental numbness.

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:37.020
We must get him to the Association 
for treatment at once.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:41.080
The boat won't arrive for 
another nine hours.

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:42.890
We need to let him rest a bit...

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:46.560
Hey, wait... Isn't this...

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.520
Hey, Teacher, is this...

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:51.190
Just leave him there.

00:02:52.390 --> 00:02:53.190
Huh?

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:02.450
I guess Sophie couldn't handle Muhyo.

00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:06.950
But that's okay.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.290
This is the moment...

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.850
...I've been waiting for.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:18.590
<b>Article 10 
Raspberries</b>

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:24.390
Lord of Hell's Furnace, Black Fire Lizard...

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:28.480
Give the calamity of the forbidden 
flames unto my hands!

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.770
That scar... That magical tool...

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.940
Ms. Rio, are you actually...

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:39.400
Rio-sensei?

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.780
He who defies Madoka-sama,

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.540
Muhyo Toru...

00:03:46.440 --> 00:03:47.580
must die!

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.390
Wh-Why...

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.070
Madoka-sama...

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.390
So that's it.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.390
First Enchu, and now you,

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:14.180
Rio?

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.770
I-It's not true...

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.940
Th-There's no doubt.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.860
That scar was made by 
forbidden magical law.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.490
Forbidden magical law?

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.330
<b>Ren</b>

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:30.880
Normal magical law uses the 
powers of a messenger from Hell

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.500
<b>Magical Law</b>

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:33.050
to punish spirits in exchange for some ren,

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.670
<b>Forbidden Magical Law</b>

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:36.880
but forbidden magical law doesn't use ren.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.080
One offers their own soul to the messenger

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:41.510
<b>Soul</b>

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.510
to gain the power to kill the living.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.510
Living people?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:48.320
And after you use forbidden 
magical law just once,

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:50.590
your contract with that 
messenger is permanent.

00:04:50.590 --> 00:04:54.070
It will eventually take all of your 
soul, turning you into an evil spirit

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:56.520
with no self-awareness.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.800
But... But...

00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:03.380
I thought magical tools masters 
couldn't use magical tools!

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:07.820
That doesn't mean they have 
zero ability to use them.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:11.290
They can, once they give ren to
 a messenger and forge a contract.

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.920
But magical tool users don't have much ren.

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.970
The only thing they have 
to offer to a messenger

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.670
is their soul.

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.720
And that means...

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.050
You guys are crazy. What 
are you talking about?

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:28.800
My teacher would never...

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:30.930
Don't, Abiko-dono!

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.360
Let me go!

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:35.460
It can't be true!

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.560
Please, ma'am...

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:40.870
Bico...

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:44.820
If you get in my way, I'll kill you, too.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.780
The one who removed your talisman...

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.330
was me.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.950
Y-You did it?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:59.350
I released a spirit just strong enough 
to deplete all of Muhyo's ren.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.920
But there were factors I hadn't counted on.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:06.180
I had to pretend to be helping you all,

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:11.930
and above all, I didn't expect Roji-kun 
to have so much hidden strength.

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:15.520
I didn't expect this woman 
to survive, either.

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:18.890
You think it's unfair, don't you?

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.440
But you know...

00:06:21.260 --> 00:06:24.270
This is how a traitor fights.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.540
That's...

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:28.040
...the mark of...

00:06:28.040 --> 00:06:29.410
...a traitor.

00:06:30.040 --> 00:06:31.410
It's not true...

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:33.560
Tell me it's not true!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.460
Ma'am!

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:43.210
Imai-san!

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.210
Go now, Kusano!

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.160
But...

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:52.590
It's all right. I'll drop 
down and save Maeda-san.

00:06:53.090 --> 00:06:57.210
Kusano, you have to keep 
Muhyo-dono and Abiko-dono safe.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:58.850
Whatever it takes.

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.820
Imai-san!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:04.480
Bico-san!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:09.240
Ma'am...

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:15.550
Hurry!

00:07:15.550 --> 00:07:17.270
You have to try, Bico-san!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:25.540
Bico-san!

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:26.840
Bico—

00:07:34.310 --> 00:07:35.800
If this is a dream...

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.560
Wake me up!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.560
You said it.

00:07:40.150 --> 00:07:42.690
I feel the same way, Bico.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.380
Yo—

00:07:44.010 --> 00:07:47.660
Dark Magic Reflect Spell!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:58.080
Yo! Did I manage to get here... in time?

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:01.740
Just barely too late.

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.330
Yoichi-san!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:06.800
Don't start crying yet.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.840
We've gotta book it out of here.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:10.600
This way, Roji!

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:11.660
Okay!

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.850
Yoichi, eh?

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.810
There's a boat on the 
other side of the island.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.880
She'll figure out that we ran 
into the forest soon enough.

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.980
It's a long way, but you can make it!

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:31.490
How'd you know to come here, Yoichi-san?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.360
I heard what happened from Bico's pupils.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:38.270
And before that, Enchu was on the move.

00:08:38.270 --> 00:08:39.900
The Association's investigation...

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:45.370
found that Rio-sensei 
was working with Enchu.

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:52.550
I couldn't believe it,

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.210
so I went to her house, and...

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.180
Then I called Nana-chan,

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.810
<b>Away on business! 
Sorry for the inconvenience!!</b>

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.810
and she said you guys were away.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.110
So I checked Bico's workshop,

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:11.020
and I found one of Bico's talismans 
with the mark of traitors on it.

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:16.600
And the nice, neat handwriting 
on the envelope it was in

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.820
was definitely Rio-sensei's.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.960
<b>Ferry Ride Across the Styx</b>

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.960
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:33.960
<b>Beelzebub's Treasure Chest</b>

00:09:31.590 --> 00:09:33.960
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.760
After you guys left the Association,

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.010
I was ordered by the Investigations Bureau

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.710
to pursue Rio-sensei along with Enchu.

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:49.290
By then, Rio-sensei had already vanished.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:54.780
Bico, you can cover your 
ears now if you want.

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:06.660
I don't want to do this, 
Director-General Page!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:10.360
This goes against my principles, too.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:13.860
It pains me to suspect someone so beautiful.

00:10:13.860 --> 00:10:14.790
But...

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:20.600
After seeing something like this...

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:27.310
The investigator who took this photo 
was later killed by a spirit.

00:10:27.310 --> 00:10:29.670
The camera was the only 
thing to survive the fire.

00:10:30.610 --> 00:10:34.570
In all likelihood, she's 
a traitor, Yoichi-kun.

00:10:34.980 --> 00:10:38.330
And now is our only chance to get her back.

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:50.580
How could this have happened

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:52.970
to yet another?

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.350
<b>My Journal</b>

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.850
<b>July 20 
I was chastised by Muhyo</b>

00:11:12.260 --> 00:11:15.110
Can't you do anything about that outfit?

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.860
Wh-What's so bad about this?

00:11:19.380 --> 00:11:22.330
I like this outfit.

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.990
Yeah, she's right! It looks fine!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:25.900
Right?

00:11:25.900 --> 00:11:26.490
Right!

00:11:26.490 --> 00:11:30.780
B-But... it might be better 
to show less skin...

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:32.090
Pervert.

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.500
<b>D'oh!</b>

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.500
<b>D'oh!</b>

00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.380
<b>July 21 
Had a nice breakfast with Mom</b>

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:41.000
Honestly, that Muhyo is so mean.

00:11:43.380 --> 00:11:46.560
Oh, that's right! I got some
 good medicinal herbs.

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:48.390
I think they'll taste great!

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:52.190
Your medicines always go down easy.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:54.520
They're just fine as they are.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:56.520
Here you go, Mom.

00:11:58.160 --> 00:11:59.780
These must have been expensive.

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.930
It was no big deal.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:05.780
It's the best way to ease the lingering 
effects of a spirit attack.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:10.410
Thank you, Rio.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.540
<b>July 22 
Worst party ever</b>

00:12:16.230 --> 00:12:19.420
You can come dressed in your usual attire.

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:23.180
The young executors will show up, too.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:26.090
I think it will be a good opportunity

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:28.950
to introduce your magical tools.

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:32.560
I'll do that, Executor Elena.

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:40.620
Hello! I'm Rio, a magical tools... master...

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:53.210
Oh, goodness! I'm so sorry!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:57.280
The young folks were suddenly 
unable to make it.

00:12:57.280 --> 00:13:00.710
And after you went to the trouble 
of coming in such shameless attire!

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.960
What a shame.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:06.280
It's okay...

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.720
<b>July 25 
A rough day</b>

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.720
Okouchi Magical Law Office

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.370
Oh?

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:15.620
You're wearing so many layers again today.

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:24.720
Is the dress I gave you underneath all this?

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:29.120
It complemented your 
porcelain skin so nicely.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:32.740
My students cautioned me against 
exposing so much skin.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.150
Hmph. Foolish little brats.

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:40.170
I appreciate the dress, 
but I really can't...

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:43.840
Take off the jacket, Rio-kun.

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:45.630
Otherwise...

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.730
No executor in the Association

00:13:48.730 --> 00:13:51.960
will ever buy your magical tools.

00:14:07.480 --> 00:14:08.530
Oh, my!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.910
I wondered who that lovely lady was.

00:14:10.910 --> 00:14:12.280
It's you, Kurotori-sensei.

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.290
Just look at that outfit!

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:22.490
You'd go to such lengths to make 
perverted men buy your magical tools?

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:26.860
Even if you need the money to 
buy medicine for your mother,

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.050
I can't imagine what you're thinking.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:41.020
Listen, Rio...

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:43.000
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:14:43.960 --> 00:14:47.030
I'm sure I don't have much time left.

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:49.320
So...

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:51.820
Stop!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.890
If you ever say that again, 
I'll never forgive you!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.710
Don't leave me alone!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.210
<b>April 2 
Bico became my pupil!!</b>

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:09.840
Hey!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.840
I told you not to go around 
touching everything!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.340
No dinner for you tonight! Go wait outside!

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.460
Look!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:44.380
<b>March 4 
Bico's initiation day...</b>

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:47.560
There. You're initiated into the art.

00:15:48.390 --> 00:15:49.880
Ma'am...

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:53.640
Now, now. Grown-ups don't cry.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:55.390
Okay?

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:04.270
Can I still come here to visit?

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:07.400
Of course. Come by anytime.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:11.100
Y-You can count on it!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.410
She's really gone, Mom...

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:24.540
You told her not to cry, 
and look at you now.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.080
You won't leave too, will you?

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.120
What will I ever do with you?

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:41.760
Yes? Who is it?

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:45.210
Rio is busy working on...

00:16:54.630 --> 00:16:55.530
Mom?

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:01.130
Mom?

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.580
Rio...

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:07.460
Run away!

00:17:08.130 --> 00:17:09.280
Mom...

00:17:09.280 --> 00:17:10.970
Hurry...

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:15.590
I'll go get an executor!

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:19.680
I ran

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:23.220
Okouchi Magical Law Office

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.220
Please! There's a spirit!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:27.850
I need your help... as an executor!

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.140
Rio-dono is requesting help.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.280
Hmph!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.140
Toss her out.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:35.990
She's been quite rebellious as of late.

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.540
Please!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.120
My shoes chafed my heels until they bled

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:46.370
Magical tools masters don't have 
the power to defeat spirits!

00:17:47.550 --> 00:17:48.880
Please!

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:56.360
There is no magical law fit to 
waste on a trashy woman like you.

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:03.890
No one would help me

00:18:06.400 --> 00:18:11.900
<i>I came all this way hoping to save 
my mother, to serve the world.</i>

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:18.400
<i>But because of crudeness, 
pride, and jealousy,</i>

00:18:18.400 --> 00:18:19.910
<i>my mother...</i>

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:19.910
Thank you, Rio

00:18:21.350 --> 00:18:22.910
<i>was killed.</i>

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.910
<b>Aaaaaaaaah</b>

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.260
<i>They're all animals.</i>

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:32.120
Why?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:34.670
Thank you, Rio

00:18:32.120 --> 00:18:33.680
<i>I'm going to...</i>

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:34.670
Mama...

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.860
<i>put everyone in this world...</i>

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.680
<i>under a curse.</i>

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:45.060
<b>I'll never forgive the people 
of the Association!!</b>

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:48.940
<b>I found someone who understands me. 
I'm so happy.</b>

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:57.920
What should I do, Sensei?

00:18:57.920 --> 00:19:01.190
What do I... What do I say to Bico?

00:19:15.270 --> 00:19:16.840
Ma'am...

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:18.810
Bico-san...

00:19:22.210 --> 00:19:23.220
Damn!

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.970
We gotta run, Bico! Grab on!

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:31.480
No...

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:34.230
Dark Magic Reflect—

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:37.860
My teacher would never do that!

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:44.450
Bico, look!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.450
<i>I mean, she was...</i>

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:47.900
<i>She was...</i>

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:51.040
Spirit Barrier Spell!

00:19:51.700 --> 00:19:55.040
Muhyo... Will Rio-sensei...

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.900
ever come back?

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:03.050
Leave Muhyo behind, and I'll 
let the rest of you live.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:06.520
Boy, are you ever confused.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:10.680
You actually think you're 
some villain already.

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:14.560
Ma'am, try to remember...

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:18.780
the time we picked raspberries 
together last year.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:22.530
Remember the time we spent together...

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:26.910
Wow! These raspberries look delicious!

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:27.780
Don't they?

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:32.570
I've been raising them myself 
because I knew you'd like them.

00:20:36.150 --> 00:20:37.460
What's wrong?

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:40.170
Teacher...

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:43.300
You haven't made any magical 
tools in about a year.

00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:48.430
You said once that even if 
something bad happened,

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:51.560
as long as you were with the one 
you care about, you'd be okay.

00:20:52.630 --> 00:20:54.940
Can't I be that person?

00:20:57.170 --> 00:21:00.940
Can't I take the place

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:02.940
of your mother?

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:07.320
I'm such a fool...

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:12.060
I know I have you, and yet...

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:14.840
It was already too late.

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:18.330
The darkness was too heavy.

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:19.840
Ma'am...

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.690
A rainbow!

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:27.090
I'm sorry, Bico.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:32.760
I didn't even notice that I had you.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:39.080
By then, I was already a traitor.

00:21:40.500 --> 00:21:43.480
If only I had met you sooner...

00:21:44.490 --> 00:21:45.490
Maybe I...

00:21:46.530 --> 00:21:47.500
But...

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.930
I can't go back now.

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:58.000
Goodbye, Bico.

00:23:31.380 --> 00:23:33.720
Long live Muhyo!

00:23:38.520 --> 00:23:42.620
Sure... if it means I get to destroy you.

00:23:43.310 --> 00:23:46.610
Next time on <i>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau 
of Supernatural Investigation</i>,

00:23:47.060 --> 00:23:48.520
Article 11:

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:54.950
<b>Article 11 
The Gamble</b>

00:23:49.340 --> 00:23:50.710
"The Gamble."

00:23:50.710 --> 00:23:53.340
Magical law will be enforced.
